      "1589986392067": {
        "type": "testimonials",
        "blocks": {
          "1589986392067-0": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>A wonderful company, will use no-one else. Yacob delivered our headboard, a fantastic finish! Outstanding job. Communication and service was excellent. </p>",
              "author": "Lisa"
            }
          },
          "1589986392067-1": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>Sheen upholstery transformed our old and damaged arm chair into an elegant and charming work of art. Even our pets love it. Really professional, corteous and competent. We highly recommend them</p>",
              "author": "Marta"
            }
          },
          "1589986476900": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>Did a great job reupholstering my old sofa. Looks like new - couldn't be happier with the work and service and thought the price was very fair for the quality and speed of the job.</p>",
              "author": "David"
            }
          },
          "1589986392067-2": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>We are very pleased, again, with Sheen Upholstery. Our heirloom Bedhead, was swiftly reupholstered after having ample choice of fabrics, collection and delivery. Always a pleasure to deal with this team.</p>",
              "author": "Malcolm"
            }
          },
          "1589988096554": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>I had a leather armchair with a broken spring which had fallen through underneath the chair. Jacob offered to come and look. He took the chair and cushion away at 12.30 and returned it completely re-upholstered at 5:30. It was a new chair. He then took an old office leather arm chair and has just returned it looking like new. Their prices are reasonable and the service is the most professional and friendly.</p>",
              "author": "Gonzo"
            }
          },
          "1589988152599": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "testimonial": "<p>Really happy with repair of our chesterfield armchair. Free collect and delivery service and very reasonably priced. Friendly, professional and trustworthy. Thanks very much.</p>",
              "author": "Hannah"
            }
          }
        },
